<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
     <%- include('partials/header') %>
    <title>Projects</title>
</head>

<body>
    <%- include('partials/main_nav') %>

    <main>
        <section class="projects">
            <h1>My Projects</h1>

            <article class="project-card">
                <h2>Python Banking App</h2>
                <p>In this project I built an app in Python that simulates how a mobile banking app would work.
                    It had features such as: creating & deleting accounts, logging in to an account, deposit & withdraw
                    money,
                    and check account balances. I created this bank app for a final assignment in a year 1 class.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="project-card">
                <h2>Network Simulator</h2>
                <p>In this project me and my group were given a network topology and were tasked to build
                    it in cisco packet tracer, once built we had to add the correct configurations that would allow
                    different networks to be able to communicate with eachother.
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="project-card">
                <h2>Vowel Counter</h2>
                <p>This is another project that was built in python. I asked the user for a string
                    of characters, the program I built would then take the input and return however many vowels
                    were in the string. If there was no vowels it would return "No vowels!".
                </p>
            </article>

            <article class="project-card">
                <h2>Simple Calcualtor</h2>
                <p>I built this project when I was in highschool in Java, it was a simple calcualtor that would
                    ask the user for two or more numbers. Once the user entered all the numbers they wanted, they are prompted
                    with what operation they want to prefrom on them, once selected it would return the result.
                </p>
            </article>
        </section>

    </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>

</html>